cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Iran provinces and cities dataset in research or a published project, please cite this repository."
authors:
  - family-names: "MrAlfak"
title: "Iran Provinces and Cities Dataset"
version: 2.1.0
url: "https://github.com/MrAlfak/List-of-provinces-and-cities-of-Iran"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MrAlfak/List-of-provinces-and-cities-of-Iran"
keywords:
  - Iran
  - Iranian cities
  - Iranian provinces
  - Persian
  - Farsi
  - administrative divisions
  - location data
  - JSON
  - CSV
  - GeoJSON
  - MySQL
  - PostgreSQL
  - REST API
license: GPL-3.0-only
abstract: >
  A source-backed dataset of 31 Iranian provinces and 1,450 canonical cities
  based on the pinned Statistical Center of Iran 1402 administrative-division
  snapshot. The repository provides JSON, CSV, GeoJSON, MySQL, PostgreSQL and
  REST API access, source-backed identifiers, administrative hierarchy,
  validation, audit tooling and reproducible data-generation workflows.
